-- Limb (iv): no word "bank" or variation, except for four kinds of name; and the section is not to be construed to
-- prevent the use of the word in a context the Division determines to be one clearly not purporting to refer to a
-- banking business and not otherwise likely to mislead the public or to lead to a pattern and practice of abuse.
