DECLARE `s 102(a)(2) Registered office and agent stated` HAS
    `the certificate states the address of the corporation's registered office in this State`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `that address is stated in accordance with § 131(c)`                                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate states the name of the corporation's registered agent at that address`                        IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:43 | (2) The address (which shall be stated in accordance with § 131(c) of this title) of the corporation’s registered office in this State, and the name of its registered agent at such address;
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(a)(2) (src:43)
GIVEN stated IS A `s 102(a)(2) Registered office and agent stated`
