    `the corporate act is otherwise valid`

-- src:45 | Nonstock corporations shall have members, but failure to have members shall not affect otherwise valid corporate acts or work a forfeiture or dissolution of the …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(a)(4) (src:45)
