@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(a)(5) (src:46)
GIVEN `the certificate states the name and mailing address of each incorporator` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(a)(5) the certificate sets forth the incorporators` `the certificate states the name and mailing address of each incorporator` MEANS
    `the certificate states the name and mailing address of each incorporator`

-- Only if the powers of the incorporators are to terminate upon the filing of the certificate must the certificate
-- name the persons who are to serve as directors until the first annual meeting or until their successors qualify.
-- src:47 | (6) If the powers of the incorporator or incorporators are to terminate upon the filing of the certificate of incorporation, the names and mailing addresses of the persons who are to serve as directors until the first annual meeting of stockholders or until their successors are elected and qualify.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(a)(6) (src:47)
GIVEN `the powers of the incorporators are to terminate upon the filing of the certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate states the names and mailing addresses of the persons who are to serve as directors until the first annual meeting of stockholders or until their successors are elected and qualify` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(a)(6) the certificate sets forth the first directors` `the powers of the incorporators are to terminate upon the filing of the certificate of incorporation` `the certificate states the names and mailing addresses of the persons who are to serve as directors until the first annual meeting of stockholders or until their successors are elected and qualify` MEANS
        (NOT (`the powers of the incorporators are to terminate upon the filing of the certificate of incorporation`))
     OR `the certificate states the names and mailing addresses of the persons who are to serve as directors until the first annual meeting of stockholders or until their successors are elected and qualify`

§§ `s 102(a) The six requirements together`

-- src:41 | (a) The certificate of incorporation shall set forth:
@ref 8 Del. C. § 102(a) (src:41)
GIVEN `the name of the corporation complies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth the registered office and registered agent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth the nature of the business or purposes` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth what paragraph (a)(4) requires` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth the incorporators` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate sets forth the first directors` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 102(a) the certificate of incorporation sets forth everything that subsection (a) requires` `the name of the corporation complies` `the certificate sets forth the registered office and registered agent` `the certificate sets forth the nature of the business or purposes` `the certificate sets forth what paragraph (a)(4) requires` `the certificate sets forth the incorporators` `the certificate sets forth the first directors` MEANS
        `the name of the corporation complies`
    AND `the certificate sets forth the registered office and registered agent`
    AND `the certificate sets forth the nature of the business or purposes`
    AND `the certificate sets forth what paragraph (a)(4) requires`
    AND `the certificate sets forth the incorporators`
    AND `the certificate sets forth the first directors`
